AI Financial Coach

This project began as a fork of the "AI Financial Coach Agent" example from
Shubham Saboo's awesome-llm-apps repository:
https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps/tree/main/advanced_ai_agents/multi_agent_apps/ai_financial_coach_agent

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Substantial changes made in this fork:
- Replaced LLM-estimated debt payoff math with deterministic Python
  amortization simulations (avalanche and snowball methods)
- Replaced LLM-estimated emergency fund sizing with a deterministic formula
- Added a Goal Planning agent and multi-goal, surplus-aware funding planner
- Added a downloadable Markdown financial report
- Added multi-month spending trend charts from uploaded CSV data
- Reworked charts onto a colorblind-safe, fixed-order palette and split
  mixed-unit comparison charts into single-metric small multiples
- Restructured the single-file script into a tested `financial_coach`
  package with unit tests, a Dockerfile, and CI-friendly project layout
